  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Holly.png|left|200px|Holly]]\nHolly is a type of [[Currencies|currency]] used to buy special prizes from the [[catalogue]]. It's part of the Christmas 2022, 2023, and 2024 events.\n\nIt is unlocked at [[experience]] level 17.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Getting holly'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.jpg|left|150 px|Riverboat]]\nEach boat during the event requires one type of [[:Category:Gift Wrapping Station Products|gift]] from the [[Gift Wrapping Station|gift wrapping station]]. Filling any box with a gift gives you a certain amount of holly.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Using holly'''===\n{{Main|Catalogue}}\n[[File:Catalogue Front With Holly.png|150px|left|The catalogue]]\nHolly can be used to purchase items from the \"Fyne & Mysterious Gifts [[Catalogue]],\" found by clicking the blue post box at the end of the driveway. Different gifts have different prices. Each gift is available only once, and for only 1 week\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Currencies]]\n[[Category:Catalogue]]\n\n{{Languages\n|es = Acebo\n}}",
